w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t-zvnqgrj6oQ7kNvwFhXd2z&_nc_oc=Adm-MKuTVDMXOmRG7P2BPH0eQqywDarzTtLpk_8lvu1z0YCzlMJN4pdG9rut1IKY_Rc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuG0PZrvmTUEblYIJx8r4gu11C7U_jdZeeUZTt2mtwPxg&oe=69A96FAA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p92RV78gGbUQ7kNvwFPCo_j&_nc_oc=AdkQmauMKGid81T9-XaTmwFYgycAIeov8pU5I0c4KarDlXVUrMkLNl0OOZQvfRF2elM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfudI19Z2uJ18YnrQqZLBZHIn875nCzBoOttkHLeyF3C6w&oe=69A9825E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1emxghfopCMQ7kNvwHDAnBf&_nc_oc=AdnJfdlNpnA6M2K-4Xvfst6jn9B-0ZSSwdmSYiLnKtkv5Vlp2AGs2BxGOkxnK19LROE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftYtQhj7yWEQHh8LDf8GAOF6VW5TWHy1yH-b-J7XYvZ-g&oe=69A97131"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9